  "priority": "Editable reusable nested elements and direct Foundation bindings. Accurate element coverage takes priority over speculative production states.",
  "scope_boundaries": [
    "Attendee journey only; hosting labels are data states, not an event-creation flow.",
    "Paid and waitlist detail states are included; checkout and waitlist forms are not supplied by the reference.",
    "Discover and Chat are navigation destinations only; their separate flows are outside this inventory.",
    "OS status indicators are editable presentation specimens, not simulated device APIs.",
    "Mobbin attribution strips are source framing and are excluded from app screens.",
    "Duplicate captures 13:7, 13:16, and 13:20 map to home_saved, home_scrolled, and detail_invited.",
    "No motion can be inferred from still images. Prototype routing will use an explicitly documented instantaneous transition.",
    "Font choice remains provisional, as authorized by Daniel."
