  "decisions": [
    "User confirmed: I want to go saves interest first; companion selection is optional; attendance is confirmed afterward.",
    "Selecting companions does not register them. Invitations and each person's registration remain separate states.",
    "Browse, prescribed feed, friends' attendance and saved/confirmed events are distinct reusable views.",
    "Friends' attendance must be shared/authorized data; no contact scraping or inferred attendance.",
    "The number and ranking of prescribed events are product inputs. A finite example batch is fixture content, not a ranking algorithm."
  ],
